WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Ken blocks Drive Impact at the wall and is splatted.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:02.700
Standing heavy punch starts the wall-splat conversion.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.550
OD Rolling Attack launches Ken.

4
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.700
Heavy Vertical Rolling Attack continues the juggle.

5
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.000
OD Vertical Rolling Attack completes the corner route.
